[I] The VA-API user mode driver for Intel GEN Graphics family

[T] intel-vaapi-driver is the VA-API (Video Acceleration API) user mode
[T] driver for the Intel GEN graphics family, from GMA 4500 up to Coffee
[T] Lake. It provides hardware accelerated video decoding and encoding to
[T] applications using libva; newer GPUs are served by the
[T] intel-media-driver.

[U] https://github.com/01org/intel-vaapi-driver

